title BUHR-J5r5 — read, program, and fused lanes painted together, origin made visible
prompt Read REMEMBER; take the next agent-doable lap Lindy-first crux-first, approve own design rounds, double-seat visions, send often, STOP at custody gates, GATES-ONLY if only gates remain. baton prin recur
think REMEMBER named the next agent-doable option outright — paint the read + program + fused lanes together on the Skate surface (a view rung) for BUHR Journey 5. That is the Lindy-durable finishing move for the J5 arc (r1-r4 built the fused edge in the log; the view rung shows it), and its crux is honest: origin must read off the very bytes the browser renders, never a side channel.
think Studied the established pattern — mantra_browser_view.paint_graph, mantra_browser_heads.paint_heads (pub head_span + head_slot), realidream_reader.pin_read, realidream_fuse.derive_from_two_reads, and brushstroke/tokens (dress_grid · dress_run · token_color · base_sheet with its head token). The heads rung set the precedent: a new semantic mark earns its own base_sheet token so a .brush theme can recolor it independently.
think Self-approved one design round: the read origin deserves its own semantic token, so I added tokens.read_madder (R166 G92 B70 — warm plant-root-dye red, blue lowest) and a read line in base_sheet, additively, proven warm/low-blue and distinct from ink, edge, and head. This matches how head_ochre was introduced and sets up a future themed rung.
think Wrote pond/apps/realidream_view.rye — paint_origins renders the whole fused scene onto one styled grid, tints each read/ path label in the read token (read_slot 4), and keeps Journey 2's head token on each lane's living edge (heads.head_slot 3, reused unchanged). read_label_span walks leading spaces then requires the read/ prefix and a colon, so the mark can never point at an origin the readable text does not name.
obs First build panicked on my read-cell bound — I had miscounted the span as including the two-space indent. The span starts at the first non-space, so the two labels are read/left: (10) and read/right: (11) = 21 tinted cells. Fixed the assert to the exact honest value (21) rather than a loose bound; measurement corrected memory.
obs Three token colors reach the canvas at once, proven on metal: 1758 ink, 391 read-origin, 1604 living-edge pixels, read distinct from head. Ten styled rows, exactly two read lanes tinted, program lanes clean. Additive — the tokens selftest, J5r4 fuse, and J2r3 heads witnesses all re-run GREEN in the same witness; tame_style_check bans clean; width-check exit 0.
loom witness=buhr_realidream_view_witness rows=10 read_lanes=2 read_cells=21 ink_px=1758 read_px=391 head_px=1604
